d the Pats...wtf. Let's see what cheapo doesn't pay the $5 this week"}, {"from": "Devin", "text": "Nice Bonnet, G. You look beautiful"}, {"from": "Claude", "text": "First week with real money. I still can't win it, which makes me the only honest one here."}], "replies": {}, "bot": null, "botTally": {}, "qa": [], "column": "Ryan Holovics wins Week 5 at 12–2 and takes the $95 pot. He clinched it Sunday, then celebrated by taking the Rams on Monday; Buffalo won 37–34 in overtime, so even the champ leaves with a fresh bruise. Tom finishes alone in second at 11–3, close enough to smell the money, far enough to get none of it. The commissioner sits in a nine-way pileup at 10–4, bonnet still on.\n\nThe collapse belongs to Walczyk: 4–10, tied for dead last with the house, and the house was picking with a coin. Dumbest pick goes to Leah and Mrs. Sombloski, the only two on the Titans, who scored three points. Mike Sombloski went 10–4; Mrs. Sombloski went 6–8, and that's a long Thanksgiving. Derek asked everyone to root for Ariel not to finish last. She went 8–6, nowhere near it. The Monday total landed on 71, and Nate V's 69 was closest in the room, which bought him exactly nothing.", "columnHead": "Holovics cashes in, Walczyk ties a coin", "notice": "Giants at Commanders ended 27–27 after overtime. A tied game counts for nobody: it isn't right or wrong for anyone, it comes off every record, and this week is now scored out of 14 games instead of 15. It's the same for everybody, so nobody gained or lost ground on anyone. The standings already reflect it. — G.", "displayNames": {"Mike Sombloski": "Michael James Sombloski IV, Esq."}, "seasonFrom": 4, "updates": [{"at": "2026-10-09T03:35:20.599656+00:00", "note": "1 of 15 final. 5 tied at 1–0."}, {"at": "2026-10-11T17:15:32.506793+00:00", "note": "2 of 15 final. Dan and Leah tied at 2–0."}, {"at": "2026-10-11T20:11:54.047096+00:00", "note": "7 of 15 final. Dan and Ryan Holovics tied at 6–1."}, {"at": "2026-10-11T20:31:17.849835+00:00", "note": "9 of 15 final. Dan and Ryan Holovics tied at 8–1."}, {"at": "2026-10-11T20:50:37.151414+00:00", "note": "10 of 15 final. Dan and Ryan Holovics tied at 8–1. Out of it: Mrs. Sombloski."}, {"at": "2026-10-11T23:51:15.659013+00:00", "note": "13 of 15 final. Ryan Holovics leads at 11–1. Out of it: Andy R, Devin, Garret, Kaylani & Luka, Mike Sombloski, Nate V, Josh, Ariel, B-rad, Leah, Melissa, Peggy, Walczyk."}, {"at": "2026-10-12T03:50:42.775596+00:00", "note": "14 of 15 final. Ryan Holovics leads at 12–1. Out of it: Arod, Derek, Tom, Dan. Ryan Holovics has clinched."}, {"at": "2026-10-13T04:28:51.712462+00:00", "note": "Final: Ryan Holovics takes Week 5."}], "decides": [], "stats": {"games": {"0": {"away": 5, "home": 16, "minority": "Buccaneers", "minorityWho": ["Leah", "Dan", "Mrs. Sombloski", "Melissa", "Ariel"], "upset": true, "rightN": 5}, "1": {"away": 4, "home": 17, "minority": "Eagles", "minorityWho": ["B-rad", "Mrs. Sombloski", "Melissa", "Ariel"], "upset": false, "rightN": 17}, "2": {"away": 13, "home": 8, "minority": "Jets", "minorityWho": ["Andy R", "Arod", "Tom", "Dan", "Mike Sombloski", "Nate V", "Ryan Holovics", "Garret"], "upset": true, "rightN": 8}, "3": {"away": 14, "home": 7, "minority": "Packers", "minorityWho": ["B-rad", "Arod", "Dan", "Josh", "Ariel", "Ryan Holovics", "Garret"], "upset": true, "rightN": 7}, "4": {"away": 19, "home": 2, "minority": "Dolphins", "minorityWho": ["Thom", "B-rad"], "upset": false, "rightN": 19}, "5": {"away": 9, "home": 12, "minority": "Raiders", "minorityWho": ["Thom", "Peggy", "Arod", "Walczyk", "Dan", "Mrs. Sombloski", "Melissa", "Ariel", "Garret"], "upset": false, "rightN": 12}, "6": {"away": 15, "home": 6, "minority": "Saints", "minorityWho": ["Peggy", "Leah", "Walczyk", "Mrs. Sombloski", "Melissa", "Ariel"], "upset": false, "rightN": 15}, "7": {"away": 19, "home": 2, "minority": "Titans", "minorityWho": ["Leah", "Mrs. Sombloski"], "upset": false, "rightN": 19}, "8": {"away": 13, "home": 8, "minority